{
  "info": {
    "name": "EMMA 電子零件 API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "EMMA 電子零件電商後端 API。\n\n使用方式：\n1. 預設連到線上 API；如需測試本機服務，將 baseUrl 改為 http://localhost:3000/api。\n2. 在 Postman 個人環境設定 memberEmail 和 memberPassword，執行「會員」的「註冊」。已註冊的會員可直接執行「登入（一般會員）」。兩個請求都會儲存會員 token。\n3. 需要測試管理員 API 時，以同樣方式設定私下取得的 adminEmail 和 adminPassword，再執行「登入（管理員）」。\n4. 執行「商品列表」會將第一筆商品 ID 存入 productId，供購物車請求使用。\n\n回應格式：`{ success, message?, data?, pagination?, errors?: [{ field, message }] }`\n需要登入的 API 使用 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`（本 Collection 已在各請求設定好）。"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://emma-parts-api.onrender.com/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "memberEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberPassword",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "newProductId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "quoteVersion",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. 健康檢查",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "服務狀態",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "確認服務運作中。Render 免費方案閒置後第一次呼叫可能需等待約 30–60 秒喚醒。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. 會員 Auth",
      "description": "註冊只接受 name / email / password；夾帶 role 等欄位一律 400，一般使用者無法提權。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "註冊",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "建立一般會員並回傳 token。密碼 8–72 碼且需含英文與數字。Email 重複回 409。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"測試會員\",\n  \"email\": \"{{memberEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{memberPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.success && j.data && j.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.data.token);",
                  "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "註冊夾帶 role（應失敗 400）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "嘗試在註冊時夾帶 role: admin，驗證會以 .strict() 拒絕。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"壞人\",\n  \"email\": \"{{memberEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{memberPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('回應 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "登入（一般會員）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "成功會把 token 存進 Collection 變數 `token`。帳密錯誤回 401。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{memberEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{memberPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.success && j.data && j.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.data.token);",
                  "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "登入（管理員）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "成功會把 token 存進 `adminToken`。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.success && j.data && j.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', j.data.token);",
                  "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "取得目前登入者",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "回傳目前登入者資料（含 role）。未帶或無效 token 回 401。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 商品 Products（公開）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "商品列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=12",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "頁碼，預設 1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "12",
                  "description": "每頁筆數 1–50，預設 12"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "分頁、分類篩選、關鍵字搜尋、排序。回應含 `pagination: { page, limit, total, totalPages, hasPrev, hasNext }`。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.success && Array.isArray(j.data) && j.data.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', j.data[0].id);",
                  "pm.test('有分頁資訊', () => pm.expect(j.pagination).to.have.property('totalPages'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "商品列表：分類篩選",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?category=電源・穩壓&page=1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "category",
                  "value": "電源・穩壓",
                  "description": "分類名稱"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "category 需為分類清單之一（見「分類清單」）。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "商品列表：關鍵字搜尋",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?keyword=IC&sort=price_asc",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "keyword",
                  "value": "IC",
                  "description": "關鍵字（最多 50 字）"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "price_asc",
                  "description": "newest / price_asc / price_desc"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "keyword 比對商品名稱、品牌、描述，不分大小寫。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "商品列表：第 2 頁",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?page=2&limit=12",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "2",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "12",
                  "description": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "展示分頁。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "分類清單",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/categories",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products",
                "categories"
              ]
            },
            "description": "所有分類與各分類上架商品數。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "單一商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "不存在或已下架回 404；id 格式錯誤回 400。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. 購物車 Cart（需登入）",
      "description": "所有請求使用一般會員 `token`。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "查看購物車",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart"
              ]
            },
            "description": "回傳 `{ items: [{ productId, product, quantity, subtotal, available, maxQuantity }], totalQuantity, total }`。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "加入商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart",
                "items"
              ]
            },
            "description": "quantity 預設 1。首次加入回 201；重複加入會累加數量並回 200。超過庫存或上限 99 回 400。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "加入不存在的商品（應失敗 404）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart",
                "items"
              ]
            },
            "description": "合法格式但查無此商品。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"000000000000000000000000\",\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('回應 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "加入不合理數量（應失敗 400）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart",
                "items"
              ]
            },
            "description": "數量為 0、負數、小數、字串或 > 99 皆回 400。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": -3\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('回應 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "修改數量",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart",
                "items",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "設定為指定數量（1–99 且不超過庫存）。不在購物車中回 404。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 3\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "移除單一商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart",
                "items",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "不在購物車中回 404。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "清空購物車",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart"
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "未登入查看購物車（應失敗 401）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cart",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart"
              ]
            },
            "description": "沒有帶 token。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('回應 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// 購物車回應都附上報價版本，結帳時必須帶回，後端用它確認買家看到的就是最新明細",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json && json.data && json.data.quoteVersion) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"quoteVersion\", json.data.quoteVersion); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. 商品管理 Admin（需管理員）",
      "description": "所有請求使用 `adminToken`。一般會員呼叫回 403。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "全部商品（含未上架）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/products?page=1&limit=12",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "12",
                  "description": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "新增商品",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "必填：title、category、price、imageUrl、stock。成功會把新商品 id 存入 `newProductId`。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"ADuM1201BRZ 數位隔離IC（測試）\",\n  \"brand\": \"Analog Devices ADI\",\n  \"category\": \"邏輯・介面IC\",\n  \"price\": 140,\n  \"originPrice\": 160,\n  \"stock\": 30,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://picsum.photos/seed/chip/800/800\",\n  \"description\": \"雙通道數位隔離器，10Mbps\",\n  \"unit\": \"顆\",\n  \"isEnabled\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
