    {
      "name": "5. 訂單 Orders（需登入）",
      "description": "結帳會以購物車內容建立訂單：後端重新計算金額、以原子操作扣庫存（不會超賣）並清空購物車。請先在購物車加入商品。運費：未滿 NT$500 收 NT$60。 下單必須帶上購物車回應中的 quoteVersion，確保送出的是買家最後看到的明細。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "建立訂單（結帳）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "先執行「3. 購物車」任一請求取得最新 `quoteVersion`（會自動存入變數）再下單。購物車或價格在這之後有變動會回 409，請重新查看購物車再送出。paymentMethod：`貨到付款`（處理中）或 `ATM 轉帳`（待付款）。夾帶 total、status 等額外欄位回 400。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quoteVersion\": \"{{quoteVersion}}\",\n  \"recipient\": {\n    \"name\": \"王小明\",\n    \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n    \"address\": \"台北市中正區重慶南路一段 122 號\"\n  },\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"貨到付款\",\n  \"note\": \"請小心包裝\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"orderId\", pm.response.json().data.id); }",
                  "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
